Two points: 

You need a valid version bump for it to propagate on Bioconductor systems. so it devel you would need to push a
 bump to 1.51.1

 There are always two active branches in Bioconductor. devel and the current release found currently on branch RELEASE_3_18. 
 You would have to push to RELEASE_3_18 branch in order fo the change to be active in release. (with a valid version bump of 1.50.1)

